<title>JAPAN: Ito-Yokado - 6mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Ito-Yokado - 6mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996  (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.50 trln	 vs	    1.42 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  119.54		vs	  116.08</p>
<p> Current	    115.19		vs	  112.02</p>
<p> Net		   41.11		vs	   41.93</p>
<p> EPS		  100.61 yen	  vs	  102.62 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ito-Yokado Co Ltd is a major supermarket chain. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
